# Compose only from `@/components/ui`

When editing Vue in `apps/web`, reuse these components. Do not recreate their look with Tailwind on raw HTML.

## Actions
- `Button` — `primary` (solid brand) | `secondary` (glass) | `ghost` | `destructive` (+ `loading` / `disabled`)
- `ButtonAccent` — outline glass (no gradient)
- `IconButton` — icon + `label` (aria); círculo `glass-clear`

## Forms
- `FormField` — label + hint + **error 422**; slot gets `{ invalid }`
- `Input` — `text` | `number` | `password` | `email` | `search` | `tel` (`glass-field` + `sv-field-control` 16px so iOS Safari does not zoom on focus). **Never** `type="date"` or `type="datetime-local"`. Do **not** use `type="tel"` for BR phone/WhatsApp — use `PhoneInput`.
- `PhoneInput` — máscara BR `(00) 0000-0000` / `(00) 00000-0000` enquanto digita; `v-model` só dígitos (o que a API já aceita, ex. `11999999999`); placeholder `(11) 99999-9999`; `glass-field`; FormField (`id`, `invalid`, `disabled`).
- `MoneyInput` — máscara BRL enquanto digita (`R$` + `1.234,56`); `v-model` decimal com ponto (`1234.56`) para schemas/`emptyToMoney`; `glass-field`; FormField (`id`, `invalid`, `disabled`). Never mask currency in a feature.
- Field text is `--sv-text-field` / class `sv-field-control` (16px). Do not put `text-[15px]` on Input, Textarea, Select, SearchField, PasswordInput, PhoneInput, MoneyInput, DatePicker, or DateTimePicker.
- `DatePicker` — date-only ISO `YYYY-MM-DD` (`v-model`); trigger `glass-field`; popover `glass-menu`; PT-BR, Monday-start. Optional `v-model:open`. Same FormField API as Select (`id`, `invalid`, `disabled`).
- `DateTimePicker` — date+time `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm` (`v-model`, datetime-local compatible); same trigger/menu as DatePicker; hour + 5-min lists; Limpar / Agora.
- `PasswordInput` — senha com mostrar/ocultar (olho)
- `Textarea`, `Select` (menu `glass-menu`), `Radio`, `Checkbox`, `Switch`
- `SearchField` (`glass-field`, radius 12 like Input/Select — **not** pill), `MaskedBox`

## Feedback / overlay
- `Banner`, `InlineAlert`, `Badge` (chips glass), `Spinner`, `Skeleton`
- Toasts: `useToastStore()` (`success` / `error` / `info`) — host is already in `App.vue` (`glass-toast`)
- `AppDialog`, `AppSheet`, `ConfirmDialog` — painéis `glass-regular` + scrim
- `EmptyState` — título + descrição + slot `action`
- `Pagination` — `page` / `lastPage` (`update:page`)
- `Tabs` — segmento (`v-model` + `items`; `block` para largura total)
- `LineChart` — série (Chart.js; cores via tokens Soft Violet; re-render no tema)
- `NavBadge` — contador numérico da nav (some se `count` for 0; `99+`)
- `ThemeToggle` — `icon` (ciclo sistema/claro/escuro) ou `segmented`; `tone` `inverse` na sidebar

## Layout
- `GlassSurface` — `material` `regular` | `clear` | `dark`
- `PageHeader` — `sticky` opcional (glass)
- `SurfaceCard` — `glass-regular`
- `ListCard` — grouped row + chevron (no pastel variants)
- `SidebarNavItem` — item da nav (shell)
- `ClinicShell` — `components/patterns` (sidebar `glass-dark` flutuante + tab bar cápsula)
- `PermissionGate` — `components/patterns`; slot só com a permission
- `ClientSearchBar` — `components/patterns`; busca com debounce (`search`)
- `MoneyDisplay` — `components/patterns`; BRL (`formatBRL`); `size` `md` | `lg`
- `StockStatusBadge` — `components/patterns`; Normal / estoque baixo / reposição / negativo
- `ItemLineRow` — `components/patterns`; produto + quantidade + preço opcional + remover (protocolos / vendas)
- `WizardStepper` — `components/patterns`; passos mobile (venda)
- `AgendaEventCard` — `components/patterns`; evento da agenda (cliente, horário, status, profissional, tratamento)
- `MetricCard` — `components/patterns`; label + valor (slot) + hint
- `RankBar` — `components/patterns`; ranking com barra proporcional (tokens)
- `NotificationInboxItem` — `components/patterns`; linha do inbox (título, message, tempo relativo, unread)

## Tokens
Use Tailwind mapped from `tokens.css` (`bg-canvas`, `bg-surface`, `text-title`, `text-muted`, `bg-brand`, `rounded-card`, `border-border-subtle`, `glass-regular`, …). Never hardcode `#5956A6`, `#F2F2F7`, or new shadows. Never invent `backdrop-filter` outside the glass utilities.

## Extending the system
1. Add or change the primitive in `apps/web/src/components/ui/`.
2. Show default, disabled, invalid, and loading on `apps/web/src/pages/DevUiPage.vue`.
3. Only then import it from a feature.

`components/ui` must not import `features/*`.
